  <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>NAYRO — A Cleaner Standard</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f5f2;
      color: #111;
    }

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px 7%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #111;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 82vh;
      padding: 90px 7%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #777;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(55px, 14vw, 120px);
      line-height: 0.88;
      letter-spacing: -6px;
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: #888;
    }

    .hero-text {
      max-width: 500px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      width: fit-content;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 16px 28px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .products {
      padding: 90px 7%;
    }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      color: #888;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 45px;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      min-height: 400px;
      padding: 28px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e7e7e7;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
    }

    .number {
      color: #999;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .product-space {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 70px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #777;
      line-height: 1.5;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .about {
      padding: 110px 7%;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
    }

    .about h2 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 80px);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .about p {
      max-width: 600px;
      color: #bbb;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .contact {
      padding: 90px 7%;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .contact h2 {
      font-size: 45px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .contact p {
      color: #777;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 28px 7%;
      background: #111;
      color: #777;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      nav {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        letter-spacing: -4px;
      }

      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .card {
        min-height: 330px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">NAYRO</div>

    <nav>
      <a href="#products">Products</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>


  <section class="hero">

    <div class="eyebrow">Modern Cleaning Solutions</div>

    <h1>
      A Cleaner<br>
      <span>Standard.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-text">
      Modern cleaning solutions designed for cleaner
      spaces, everyday living and a better cleaning experience.
    </p>

    <a class="btn" href="#products">
      Explore Products →
    </a>

  </section>


  <section class="products" id="products">

    <div class="section-label">NAYRO Collection</div>

    <h2 class="section-title">Our Products</h2>

    <div class="grid">

      <div class="card">
        <div class="number">01</div>

        <div class="product-space">🧴</div>

        <h3>Floor Cleaner</h3>

        <p>
          Everyday cleaning for a fresh and clean floor.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="card">
        <div class="number">02</div>

        <div class="product-space">🫧</div>

        <h3>Bathroom Cleaner</h3>

        <p>
          Designed for everyday bathroom surface cleaning.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="card">
        <div class="number">03</div>

        <div class="product-space">✨</div>

        <h3>Glass Cleaner</h3>

        <p>
          Helps keep glass surfaces clean and clear.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="about" id="about">

    <div class="section-label">About NAYRO</div>

    <h2>Cleaning should be simple.</h2>

    <p>
      NAYRO is a modern cleaning brand focused on creating
      practical cleaning solutions with a clean, simple and
      contemporary experience.
    </p>

  </section>


  <section class="contact" id="contact">

    <div class="section-label">Get In Touch</div>

    <h2>Let's connect.</h2>

    <p>
      Interested in NAYRO products or want to know more?
    </p>

    <a class="btn" href="mailto:nayro@example.com">
      Contact NAYRO →
    </a>

  </section>


  <footer>
    © 2026 NAYRO. All rights reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
